Jira comment 18214 / docs/solutions/NEARS-3089-getfind-binder-audit.md claim for
this file: "6 sites | 6 (a) | 0 (b)" — reasoning given covers only two buckets:
(1) SplashController.configModel reads in build(), (2) AuthController.enableOtpView
in onPressed.

Actual grep of the file (QA-run, this session):

