    13 Get.find<SplashController>
  (19 raw occurrences total; 18 live + 1 commented-out at line 335)

  $ grep -n "Get\.find<" login_suggestion_bottomsheet.dart
  30:    bool googleLoginActive = Get.find<SplashController>()...
